# X-19 v6 lock (clean rebuild, 2026-11-23). Format: <sha256> <path inside X19.xcframework>
# v6 is the same wrapper source and module set as v5 (Argon2IDKey, GenerateArmoredKey, PublicArmor, DecryptArmoredText), built with -trimpath, a neutral
# work folder (/tmp/x19w), ZERO_AR_DATE=1 and a fixed framework version, so that the binaries hold no path of the build machine and two builds are
# byte-identical (see build-x19-xcframework.sh and DELIVERY.md). v5 held build-machine paths and was withdrawn before publication.
# The MANIFEST line is the SHA-256 of the sorted list of all files (see verify-x19-xcframework.sh).
